###
run ./login.http

### CREATE_SUBSCRIPTIONS
POST {{SUBSCRIPTIONS_API_ENDPOINT}}/subscriptions/commands/add-queue-subscription
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": ["HistoryItemEvent"]
}

### GET_SUBSCRIPTIONS
GET {{SUBSCRIPTIONS_API_ENDPOINT}}/subscriptions
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### DELETE_SUBSCRIPTIONS
POST {{SUBSCRIPTIONS_API_ENDPOINT}}/subscriptions/commands/delete
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriptionId": "{{subscriptionId}}"
}
